   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t01**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ween2009-09-01d1t08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2009-09-01.TaperSteveProductions** (recommended): audience recording; 41 songs; 186 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the audience recording's set, playing and recording excellent, taped under the TaperSteveProductions label [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the band played a very long set with many songs, and that they have seen people collapse after such shows [2]\n- Soundcheck included Roses Are Free, and the crowd is noted as dancing during the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2009-09-01.TaperSteveProductions**: taped by TaperSteve; transferred by TaperSteve Productions; source: High Quality Audience Recording [1]",
